      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "From him, from Muhammad Bin Sinan, from Al A’ala Bin Al Fuzyal who said, ",
          "‘Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘When a man intends to strike a man unjustly, so the man fights or defends himself and causes him harm, so there is nothing upon him’."
